/-! ## Weight index (mod 3^9 = 19683, five floors); same unit enumeration -/

/-- Zero-based enumeration of the positive unit residues modulo `19683`:
`r = 3q+1` maps to `2q`, `r = 3q+2` to `2q+1`. -/
def harmonicUnitIndex (r : ℕ) : ℕ :=
  2 * (r / 3) + if r % 3 = 2 then 1 else 0

